        "summary": "Calendly added sales to a business that was initially almost entirely PLG, using inbound interest and product-qualified leads to turn team usage into organization-wide sales conversations. Its early motion suited reps experienced in inbound, expansion-oriented selling—not primarily outbound hunters.",
        "summary_citation_ids": [
          "S1",
